WEBVTT

00:09:56.425 --> 00:10:01.764
And when COP 27 convenes
in Egypt in November 2022,

00:10:01.805 --> 00:10:04.099
we should tell the attending leaders

00:10:04.099 --> 00:10:08.062
that it's not enough to make
vague future pledges

00:10:08.062 --> 00:10:11.106
about 1.5 degrees Celsius.

00:10:11.148 --> 00:10:13.859
We want them to take out their pens

00:10:13.859 --> 00:10:15.277
and sign a check

00:10:15.319 --> 00:10:19.406
for two percent of annual global GDP.

00:10:20.115 --> 00:10:21.241
Thank you.